{"id":"52c8a110-41df-45de-996a-cee6449e13ff","object":"chat.completion","created":1793244587,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"thought\":\"Note write failed because evidence_ids must be a JSON array, not a string. Retry with a proper list.\",\"code\":\"r=write_note('Overview: framing and three categories','论文把 agentic LLM 定义为能 (1) reason、(2) act、(3) interact 的 LLM，并据此组织全文（p1 摘要、p2 §1）。三类互补：retrieval enables tool use，reflection improves multi-agent collaboration，reasoning benefits all categories（p1）。图 1 展示 reasoning-acting-interacting 良性循环：agent 与世界交互生成新数据用于预训练/微调/推理时增强（p2-3）。贡献：综述三类技术、说明互补与数据生成、提出研究议程（Table 4, §5）。文献选择方法见 §1.2（p5），待补。',['ev-03c9580cc4ea3469a3d3','ev-c3c928f38ebc0ac0c6cd','ev-84af1a450301aa5252ba'],'overview')\\nprint(r)\"}"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":7441,"completion_tokens":240,"total_tokens":7681,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":4480},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":4480,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":2961},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}